{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45217","headline":"雪夜送海上人常州觐叔父上人殷仲文後 · 皎然","name":"雪夜送海上人常州觐叔父上人殷仲文後","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"继世风流在，传心向一灯。\n望云裁衲惯，翫雪步花能。\n交战情忘久，销魂别未曾。\n明朝阮家集，知有竹林僧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45217.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45217","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}